flowchart TD
    Detect[Health rule detects condition] --> Evidence[Preserve evidence + scope]
    Evidence --> Classify[Classify severity and risk]
    Classify --> Snapshot[Create or verify snapshot]
    Snapshot --> Sandbox[Restore / simulate in sandbox]
    Sandbox --> Plan[Create typed plan with cost + rollback]
    Plan --> Policy{Policy allows?}
    Policy -- No --> Deny[Reject and audit]
    Policy -- Yes --> Approval{Approval required?}
    Approval -- Yes --> Human[Human reviews evidence]
    Approval -- No --> Canary[Canary or bounded execution]
    Human -- Reject --> Deny
    Human -- Approve --> Canary
    Canary --> Execute[Restricted executor]
    Execute --> Verify[Verify postconditions]
    Verify --> Healthy{Healthy?}
    Healthy -- Yes --> Commit[Commit result + audit]
    Healthy -- No --> Rollback[Rollback / restore + audit]
